  "transcript": [
    {
      "round": 1,
      "name": "Pia Kowalski",
      "persona_id": "P4",
      "group": "P",
      "spoke": true,
      "word_count": 19,
      "text": "We can’t afford to hesitate. Blue Lake Cabin is the safest option with supplies. What do you all think?"
    },
    {
      "round": 1,
      "name": "Quinn Doherty",
      "persona_id": "N13",
      "group": "N",
      "spoke": true,
      "word_count": 24,
      "text": "I hear Pia's point about Blue Lake being safe, but we also need to consider the dam release. What if the bridge gets worse?"
    },
    {
      "round": 1,
      "name": "Rania Khoury",
      "persona_id": "N14",
      "group": "N",
      "spoke": true,
      "word_count": 22,
      "text": "I appreciate the urgency, but we need to think about the bridge condition too. It might not hold up under strong winds."
    },
    {
      "round": 1,
      "name": "Olga Ivanova",
      "persona_id": "D4",
      "group": "D",
      "spoke": true,
      "word_count": 27,
      "text": "We can't waste time debating. Blue Lake Cabin is the best choice; it has supplies and is safe. We need to head there now. No more delays."
    },
    {
      "round": 1,
      "name": "Dev Raman",
      "persona_id": "N2",
      "group": "N",
      "spoke": true,
      "word_count": 26,
      "text": "I understand the urgency, but we need to address the bridge situation. It's just washed out, and if it’s not safe, we can't risk heading there."
    },
    {
      "round": 2,
      "name": "Rania Khoury",
      "persona_id": "N14",
      "group": "N",
      "spoke": true,
      "word_count": 29,
      "text": "I hear the urgency, but we really need to think longer about the bridge. If it fails, we could be in serious trouble trying to reach Blue Lake Cabin."
    },
    {
      "round": 2,
      "name": "Olga Ivanova",
      "persona_id": "D4",
      "group": "D",
      "spoke": true,
      "word_count": 28,
      "text": "We don't have time for more debate. Let's focus on Blue Lake Cabin. It's our safest option, and it has supplies. We need to decide now and move."
    },
    {
      "round": 2,
      "name": "Quinn Doherty",
      "persona_id": "N13",
      "group": "N",
      "spoke": true,
      "word_count": 23,
      "text": "I know Blue Lake has supplies, but we really need to weigh the risks of the bridge. If it collapses, we're in trouble."
    },
    {
      "round": 2,
      "name": "Pia Kowalski",
      "persona_id": "P4",
      "group": "P",
      "spoke": true,
      "word_count": 26,
      "text": "I hear the concerns about the bridge. But we can't ignore that Blue Lake Cabin has supplies and safety. It's a risk we need to take."
    },
    {
      "round": 2,
      "name": "Dev Raman",
      "persona_id": "N2",
      "group": "N",
      "spoke": true,
      "word_count": 25,
      "text": "I get the urgency around Blue Lake, but we can't ignore the bridge issue. If it just washed out, we have to rethink our approach."
    },
    {
      "round": 3,
      "name": "Quinn Doherty",
      "persona_id": "N13",
      "group": "N",
      "spoke": true,
      "word_count": 26,
      "text": "We can't just ignore the bridge issue. If it collapses, getting to Blue Lake could be dangerous. We really need to weigh that risk more seriously."
    },
    {
      "round": 3,
      "name": "Olga Ivanova",
      "persona_id": "D4",
      "group": "D",
      "spoke": true,
      "word_count": 27,
      "text": "We need to make a decision quickly. Blue Lake Cabin is the safest option, despite the bridge concerns. We can't afford to waste time debating this further."
    },
    {
      "round": 3,
      "name": "Dev Raman",
      "persona_id": "N2",
      "group": "N",
      "spoke": true,
      "word_count": 25,
      "text": "I understand we need to make a decision, but we can't ignore the bridge issue. It's crucial to weigh that risk seriously before moving forward."
    },
    {
      "round": 3,
      "name": "Rania Khoury",
      "persona_id": "N14",
      "group": "N",
      "spoke": true,
      "word_count": 28,
      "text": "I understand the urgency, but we have to consider the bridge's condition. If it's unsafe, we could be putting ourselves at risk by heading to Blue Lake Cabin."
    },
    {
      "round": 3,
      "name": "Pia Kowalski",
      "persona_id": "P4",
      "group": "P",
      "spoke": true,
      "word_count": 23,
      "text": "I get everyone's concerns, but we need to make a decision. Blue Lake Cabin is our safest bet. Can we agree on that?"
